{"seq":2,"slug":"tests-agents-can-work-with","title":"Tests Agents Can Work With","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/tests-agents-can-work-with","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"readable-fast-deterministic-tests","title":"可读、快速、确定的测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/tests-agents-can-work-with/readable-fast-deterministic-tests","wordCount":1792,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-structure-and-naming","title":"测试的结构与命名","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/tests-agents-can-work-with/test-structure-and-naming","wordCount":1823,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"avoiding-flaky-tests","title":"避免脆测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-testing/tests-agents-can-work-with/avoiding-flaky-tests","wordCount":1846,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲什么样的测试 agent 真能用得上:测试要可读(agent 一看就懂这条在测什么)、快(快到能在每次改动后随手跑、构成紧的反馈回路)、确定(同样的代码同样的结果,不会时过时不过);要有清晰的结构和命名(给什么、做什么、断言什么三段分明,名字描述被测行为),agent 才能读懂、仿写、定位失败;还要避免脆测试(依赖时间、顺序、外部服务、实现细节的测试),因为脆测试一旦假红,就会误导 agent 瞎改、侵蚀它对测试的信任,让护栏形同虚设。\n"}